		{
			"id": "su5QhCLx",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 741,
			"y": 160.83333333333348,
			"width": 343.19952392578125,
			"height": 500,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "Zx",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 804617030,
			"version": 686,
			"versionNonce": 256041234,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530840816,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Need：\nEncryption\n- Data at rest\n- Data in transit\n- Data in use (memory)\n\nBest Practices:\n- Clean desk\n- no shoulder surfing (in elevator risk\nis higher)\n- screen filter(laptop and mobile\ndevice)\n- PC locking(\n- MFA\n- Access Control\n- Strong PW\n- Need to know & Least Privilege\n\nThreat:\n- Cryptanalysis\n- Social engineering\n- Key Loggers (SW/HW)\n- Cameras\n- steganography 隐写术（偷偷转移数据）\n- IoT (back door)",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "7xeS2VKqYRsQxl4chhNrE",
			"originalText": "Need：\nEncryption\n- Data at rest\n- Data in transit\n- Data in use (memory)\n\nBest Practices:\n- Clean desk\n- no shoulder surfing (in elevator risk is higher)\n- screen filter(laptop and mobile device)\n- PC locking(\n- MFA\n- Access Control\n- Strong PW\n- Need to know & Least Privilege\n\nThreat:\n- Cryptanalysis\n- Social engineering\n- Key Loggers (SW/HW)\n- Cameras\n- steganography 隐写术（偷偷转移数据）\n- IoT (back door)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "Need：\nEncryption\n- Data at rest\n- Data in transit\n- Data in use (memory)\n\nBest Practices:\n- Clean desk\n- no shoulder surfing (in elevator risk is higher)\n- screen filter(laptop and mobile device)\n- PC locking(\n- MFA\n- Access Control\n- Strong PW\n- Need to know & Least Privilege\n\nThreat:\n- Cryptanalysis\n- Social engineering\n- Key Loggers (SW/HW)\n- Cameras\n- steganography 隐写术（偷偷转移数据）\n- IoT (back door)",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
