			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Need：\n- Encryption\n- Checksum(CRC)检验和\n- MD/Hash (MD5,SHA1 or SHA2)\n- Digital signature 否认防止\n- Access Control\n\nThreat:\n- Alterations\n- Code injections\n- Cryptanalysis\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "bGi0l700F2oq6ApfVinMe",
			"originalText": "Need：\n- Encryption\n- Checksum(CRC)检验和\n- MD/Hash (MD5,SHA1 or SHA2)\n- Digital signature 否认防止\n- Access Control\n\nThreat:\n- Alterations\n- Code injections\n- Cryptanalysis\n",
