			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721336,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Need：\n- IPS/IDS\n- Patch Management\n- Redundancy (多个Power，UPS，发电机等）\n- Disk（RAID）\n- Traffic Paths（多个ISP）\n- HVAC， staff, HA (Hight availability)\n\n- 法律约束（SLA等）\n\nThreat：\n- Malicious attack\n- DDoS\n- physical\n- system compromise\n- staff\n- Application failure 软件漏洞\n- component failure (HW) 系统组件损坏\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "_e2tVC_Delm0Gm_mQoXpx",
			"originalText": "Need：\n- IPS/IDS\n- Patch Management\n- Redundancy (多个Power，UPS，发电机等）\n- Disk（RAID）\n- Traffic Paths（多个ISP）\n- HVAC， staff, HA (Hight availability)\n\n- 法律约束（SLA等）\n\nThreat：\n- Malicious attack\n- DDoS\n- physical\n- system compromise\n- staff\n- Application failure 软件漏洞\n- component failure (HW) 系统组件损坏\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
