			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721336,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "①Identification\nName, Username, ID, etc\n②Authentication\n- Type1 ~ you know: knowledge factor\nPW, passphrase, PIN\ncost最低，使用最广泛\n- Type2 ~ you have: possession factor\nIP, passport, smart card, token(SW/HW), cookie等\n- Type3 ~ you are: biometrics\nfingerprint, iris scan, facial \ncost最高\n③Authorization 授权\nAccess Control \n➩　subject主体: users/ programs\n➩　object客体： data, paper\nPrinciples\n- Need to know\n- Least Privilege\n④Accountability (Auditing)\n记录\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "Bxg4e1Yjaf1a7MW04p14c",
			"originalText": "①Identification\nName, Username, ID, etc\n②Authentication\n- Type1 ~ you know: knowledge factor\nPW, passphrase, PIN\ncost最低，使用最广泛\n- Type2 ~ you have: possession factor\nIP, passport, smart card, token(SW/HW), cookie等\n- Type3 ~ you are: biometrics\nfingerprint, iris scan, facial \ncost最高\n③Authorization 授权\nAccess Control \n➩　subject主体: users/ programs\n➩　object客体： data, paper\nPrinciples\n- Need to know\n- Least Privilege\n④Accountability (Auditing)\n记录\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
