			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "NIST 800-30\n9 Steps\n\nKGI: Key Goal Index\nKPI: Key Performance Index\nKRI: Key Risk Index\nRisk Management Model 成熟度模型\n- Lv1: Initial\n- Lv2: Repeatable\n- Lv3: Defined\n- Lv4: Managed\n- Lv5: Optimizing\n\nRACI chart 可尝试\nResponsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "aiVGx5f92py__y41jTwW_",
			"originalText": "NIST 800-30\n9 Steps\n\nKGI: Key Goal Index\nKPI: Key Performance Index\nKRI: Key Risk Index\nRisk Management Model 成熟度模型\n- Lv1: Initial\n- Lv2: Repeatable\n- Lv3: Defined\n- Lv4: Managed\n- Lv5: Optimizing\n\nRACI chart 可尝试\nResponsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed",
