			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1735286189216,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Privacy 法律保护\nEU\n- 限制访问，法律取证，国家安全，军事，公共安全\n个人诈\n- Right to access\n- Right to erasure\n- Data portability\n- Data breach notification\n- Privacy by design + Data Protection officer\nUS\n- HIPAA: Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act\n- Security Breach Notifications Laws\n- ECPA: Electronic Communications Privacy Act\n- PATRIOT Act of 2001\n- CFAA: Computer Fraud and Abuse Act\n- GLBA: Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act\n- SOX: Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002\n- PCI-DSS 信用卡+借记卡",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "HiiimHLYV_-Eq_bqa8ViA",
			"originalText": "Privacy 法律保护\nEU\n- 限制访问，法律取证，国家安全，军事，公共安全\n个人诈\n- Right to access\n- Right to erasure\n- Data portability\n- Data breach notification\n- Privacy by design + Data Protection officer\nUS\n- HIPAA: Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act\n- Security Breach Notifications Laws\n- ECPA: Electronic Communications Privacy Act\n- PATRIOT Act of 2001\n- CFAA: Computer Fraud and Abuse Act\n- GLBA: Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act\n- SOX: Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002\n- PCI-DSS 信用卡+借记卡",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
