			"locked": false,
			"text": "与Backup比较\nArchive用于后续检索➩ Retrieve 失物招领\nBackup用于数据成得，原数据不删除➩ Restore",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "与Backup比较\nArchive用于后续检索➩ Retrieve 失物招领\nBackup用于数据成得，原数据不删除➩ Restore",
