		{
			"id": "uEWQUlOa",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 6611.027777777781,
			"y": 1777.8888888888891,
			"width": 827.859375,
			"height": 720,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b31",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1283322314,
			"version": 460,
			"versionNonce": 1159033226,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1733928478566,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Memory & Data Remanence 删除后的数据残留\nMemory \n- ROM\n    * PROM 只能写入1次\n    * EPROM 用紫外线写入多次（BIOS）\n    * EEPROM 用充电写入多次（构成Firmware）\n- PLD 可编程逻辑设备\nCache Memory\nL1 在CPU上\nL2 在CPU外，连着CPU\nSSD 无法能消磁，只能用ATA Secure Erase或破坏\nFlash Memory 亲存\n- RAM\n    * SRAM\n    * DRAM\n    * SDRAM 如DDR1，2，3，4，5用作内存条",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Memory & Data Remanence 删除后的数据残留\nMemory \n- ROM\n    * PROM 只能写入1次\n    * EPROM 用紫外线写入多次（BIOS）\n    * EEPROM 用充电写入多次（构成Firmware）\n- PLD 可编程逻辑设备\nCache Memory\nL1 在CPU上\nL2 在CPU外，连着CPU\nSSD 无法能消磁，只能用ATA Secure Erase或破坏\nFlash Memory 亲存\n- RAM\n    * SRAM\n    * DRAM\n    * SDRAM 如DDR1，2，3，4，5用作内存条",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "03j4giCodH_wSNDwu-zCA",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 6768.527777777781,
			"y": 1.222222222222399,
			"width": 952.5,
			"height": 685,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b32",
			"roundness": {
				"type": 3
			},
			"seed": 1439908054,
			"version": 41,
			"versionNonce": 9176278,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"id": "FaEwTRDZ"
				}
			],
			"updated": 1733927521040,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"customData": {
				"legacyTextWrap": true
			},
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
		{
			"id": "FaEwTRDZ",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 6773.527777777781,
			"y": 6.222222222222399,
			"width": 908.9995727539062,
			"height": 675,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b33",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 208663126,
			"version": 431,
			"versionNonce": 1941358738,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721349,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Data Destruction\n1) Paper disposal 碎纸机且是Cross shredding\n2) Digital disposal\n- Delete 仍可恢复\n- Format 格式化， 大多数情况下可恢复\n- Overwrite Os或是随机字符\n- Sanitization 清理（深度），软件不可恢复（实验室\n环境中仍有残留）\n- Purge 去除敏感信息\n3) Degaussing 置于强磁场中破坏介质完整性\n4）Physical destruction\n- Disk crushers 扭转碟片\n- Shredders \n- Incineration 焚烧， Pulverizing粉碎， melting\n溶解，acid 酸蚀 //物理上消灭",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "03j4giCodH_wSNDwu-zCA",
			"originalText": "Data Destruction\n1) Paper disposal 碎纸机且是Cross shredding\n2) Digital disposal\n- Delete 仍可恢复\n- Format 格式化， 大多数情况下可恢复\n- Overwrite Os或是随机字符\n- Sanitization 清理（深度），软件不可恢复（实验室\n环境中仍有残留）\n- Purge 去除敏感信息\n3) Degaussing 置于强磁场中破坏介质完整性\n4）Physical destruction\n- Disk crushers 扭转碟片\n- Shredders \n- Incineration 焚烧， Pulverizing粉碎， melting\n溶解，acid 酸蚀 //物理上消灭",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
