			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1733928092396,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "其他概念\n1） DRM: Digital Rights Management \nDVDs等，加密防copy, edit, saving, screenshots, screen recording, print\n添加水印或是meta data嵌入，截图，录屏，以及Adobe PDF编辑限制\n2）CASB：Cloud Access Security Broker\n监视用户活动，报警，防止 Shadow IT\n3） DLP： Data Loss Prevention\n比如Guardwall (Canon: Mail Security)\n\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "其他概念\n1） DRM: Digital Rights Management \nDVDs等，加密防copy, edit, saving, screenshots, screen recording, print\n添加水印或是meta data嵌入，截图，录屏，以及Adobe PDF编辑限制\n2）CASB：Cloud Access Security Broker\n监视用户活动，报警，防止 Shadow IT\n3） DLP： Data Loss Prevention\n比如Guardwall (Canon: Mail Security)\n\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
