			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734099340381,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Clipping Levels: 允许正常用户输错后等待一段时间后再试或由管理员解锁\nPrevent administrative overhead\nPW management\nUS DoD推荐\n1) >= 24 世代\n2) Max PW age: 90days\n3) Min PW age: 2days （防止快速绕过1）的限制）\n4）Min PW length: 14\n5) 满足复杂性要求\n6) 不允许可逆加密存储",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Clipping Levels: 允许正常用户输错后等待一段时间后再试或由管理员解锁\nPrevent administrative overhead\nPW management\nUS DoD推荐\n1) >= 24 世代\n2) Max PW age: 90days\n3) Min PW age: 2days （防止快速绕过1）的限制）\n4）Min PW length: 14\n5) 满足复杂性要求\n6) 不允许可逆加密存储",
