			"updated": 1734099345584,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ID, Passport, Smartcard, token, cookie on PC\n1) Single-Use PW\n2) Smart Cards\n    - contact cards 接触式\n    - contactless card 如RFID 非接触式\n3) Magnetic Stripe card 磁条卡发，如银行卡\n4) Tokens\n    - HOTP (HMAC-base One-Time PW)\n    - TOTP (Time-based One-Time PW)\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "ID, Passport, Smartcard, token, cookie on PC\n1) Single-Use PW\n2) Smart Cards\n    - contact cards 接触式\n    - contactless card 如RFID 非接触式\n3) Magnetic Stripe card 磁条卡发，如银行卡\n4) Tokens\n    - HOTP (HMAC-base One-Time PW)\n    - TOTP (Time-based One-Time PW)\n",
