			"version": 459,
			"versionNonce": 476120778,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734003997411,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Identity and Access Provisioning\nLifecycle 管理：从创建到销户\nFederated Identity\nFIDM: Federated Identity Management)\n- 子集 SSO：Single Sign-On\n还有\n- SAML: Security Assertion Markup Language\n- Super Sign-On 授权访问（如Gmail，Facebook，twitter,QQ账户等）\n- IDaaS",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Identity and Access Provisioning\nLifecycle 管理：从创建到销户\nFederated Identity\nFIDM: Federated Identity Management)\n- 子集 SSO：Single Sign-On\n还有\n- SAML: Security Assertion Markup Language\n- Super Sign-On 授权访问（如Gmail，Facebook，twitter,QQ账户等）\n- IDaaS",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
