		{
			"id": "ybDo1trF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 16994.36111111112,
			"y": 517.6111111111122,
			"width": 1563.64453125,
			"height": 1080,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b5C",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1634686922,
			"version": 1012,
			"versionNonce": 77984198,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734099320379,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Kerberos\n对称密钥，使用UDP Port 88\n过程需要理解并掌握 6步\n2. SESAME: Secure European System for Application in a Multi-vendor Environment\n未广泛使用\n3. RADIUS: Remote Authentication Dial-in User Service\nUDP Port 1812 for authentication\n        1813 for accounting\nTCP with TLS for security\n4.Diameter:提供AAA\n被视为取代RADIUS的方案\n广泛用于3G\n5. TACACS: The Terminal Access Controller Access Control Protocol\n6. TACACS+ 对TACACS不向下兼容\n7. PAD：Password Authentication Protocol\n不再安全，明文传送\n8. CHAP: Challenge-Handshake Authentication Protocol\n9. AD: Active Directory\n- Trust Domains\n    * One-way Domains\n    * Two-way Domains\n    * Trusted Domain\n    * Transitive Trust\n    * Intransitive (Non-transitive) Trust",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. Kerberos\n对称密钥，使用UDP Port 88\n过程需要理解并掌握 6步\n2. SESAME: Secure European System for Application in a Multi-vendor Environment\n未广泛使用\n3. RADIUS: Remote Authentication Dial-in User Service\nUDP Port 1812 for authentication\n        1813 for accounting\nTCP with TLS for security\n4.Diameter:提供AAA\n被视为取代RADIUS的方案\n广泛用于3G\n5. TACACS: The Terminal Access Controller Access Control Protocol\n6. TACACS+ 对TACACS不向下兼容\n7. PAD：Password Authentication Protocol\n不再安全，明文传送\n8. CHAP: Challenge-Handshake Authentication Protocol\n9. AD: Active Directory\n- Trust Domains\n    * One-way Domains\n    * Two-way Domains\n    * Trusted Domain\n    * Transitive Trust\n    * Intransitive (Non-transitive) Trust",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
