			"text": "要点：\n- Physical security 入退室 \n    Proper access control and monitoring\n- Network security: \n    FW配置，network segment, intrusion detection, prevention systems\n- System and application security\n    正确配置，patching, against vulnerabilities\n- Data Security\n    Classification, storage, handling, protection of 机密数据\n- System and application logs\n    管理Policy, violation, misuse, potential security incidents\n- configuration management\n    基于Best Practices的配置和组织政策，以及变更管理\n- Challenges\n    抓取准确的资产清单变得困难",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "FnwgMp1-DCI5Z-TrlMvxK",
			"originalText": "要点：\n- Physical security 入退室 \n    Proper access control and monitoring\n- Network security: \n    FW配置，network segment, intrusion detection, prevention systems\n- System and application security\n    正确配置，patching, against vulnerabilities\n- Data Security\n    Classification, storage, handling, protection of 机密数据\n- System and application logs\n    管理Policy, violation, misuse, potential security incidents\n- configuration management\n    基于Best Practices的配置和组织政策，以及变更管理\n- Challenges\n    抓取准确的资产清单变得困难",
