			"updated": 1795530721351,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Shared Responsibility Model\n    PaaS, IaaS, SaaS\n- limited visibility into infra\n- compliance with industry-specific regulations (GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS等)\n- Data sovereignty \n    理解法律要求，哪些数据应用何种方式存储和处理\n- 主要责任还是在公司，不认经CSP的责任范围有多大\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "w4YKAeoSmYpkbnaPHzD6u",
			"originalText": "- Shared Responsibility Model\n    PaaS, IaaS, SaaS\n- limited visibility into infra\n- compliance with industry-specific regulations (GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS等)\n- Data sovereignty \n    理解法律要求，哪些数据应用何种方式存储和处理\n- 主要责任还是在公司，不认经CSP的责任范围有多大\n",
