			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721351,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Connections between A and B\n- Proper segmentation and access control\n- complexity \n- Integration\n- Data flow\n- Incident response\nGeneral Best Practices of Audit\n- Clear objectives and scope (system, application, data)\n- Audit类型 compliance or risk-based \n    Highest risk based on data sensitivity, system criticality,\npotential impact of security breach\n- 手动与自动结合，可用于AI，但要人工复查\n- Review policies, procedure, documentation\n- 请相关责任人参与\n- Follow up 定期Review，改善状况",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "wmFsTaA6eix16DIalh4ea",
			"originalText": "- Connections between A and B\n- Proper segmentation and access control\n- complexity \n- Integration\n- Data flow\n- Incident response\nGeneral Best Practices of Audit\n- Clear objectives and scope (system, application, data)\n- Audit类型 compliance or risk-based \n    Highest risk based on data sensitivity, system criticality,\npotential impact of security breach\n- 手动与自动结合，可用于AI，但要人工复查\n- Review policies, procedure, documentation\n- 请相关责任人参与\n- Follow up 定期Review，改善状况",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "exgJSYiP",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 21476.694444444445,
			"y": 670.444444444445,
			"width": 1362.311767578125,
			"height": 585,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b5q",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 901131910,
			"version": 534,
			"versionNonce": 466686785,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734877096785,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "具体Audit办法\n1）一般CSP不允许对DC的外审\n2）一般会提交SOC2，ISO27001, FedRAMP并开示\n3）IaaS\n要点：正确配置，patching, VM安全性，Access Control\n4) PaaS\n要点：Proper design, testing, security of application, data and access control\n5) SaaS\n要点：无\nSLA内容应包含\n- 合意：about privacy, security and data protection\n            data ownership, location, retention, destruction\n针对Breach or security incident的责任划分和应对计划",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "具体Audit办法\n1）一般CSP不允许对DC的外审\n2）一般会提交SOC2，ISO27001, FedRAMP并开示\n3）IaaS\n要点：正确配置，patching, VM安全性，Access Control\n4) PaaS\n要点：Proper design, testing, security of application, data and access control\n5) SaaS\n要点：无\nSLA内容应包含\n- 合意：about privacy, security and data protection\n            data ownership, location, retention, destruction\n针对Breach or security incident的责任划分和应对计划",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
