			"updated": 1734877096785,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "SOC1:\ninternal control over financial reporting\nTypeI: Opinion on design effectiveness, 每次1个关注点\nTypeII: ~ on design and reporting effectiveness, covers min 6months\ntime period\nSOC2:\ninternal controls for compliance and operations\n必须满足 trust service criteria (由AICPA定义）\nShared Under NDA\n- security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality and\nprivacy\n- TypeI: 每次1point评价，design of controls的妥当性\n- TypeII: 评价Design controls的妥当性和operating controls的有效性\nmin 6 months time period\nSOC3: // public available \n类似SOC2， more generalized, shorter, less sensitive document\n\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ZPu8cW8Tl7TsBpCnRSwvV",
			"originalText": "SOC1:\ninternal control over financial reporting\nTypeI: Opinion on design effectiveness, 每次1个关注点\nTypeII: ~ on design and reporting effectiveness, covers min 6months\ntime period\nSOC2:\ninternal controls for compliance and operations\n必须满足 trust service criteria (由AICPA定义）\nShared Under NDA\n- security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality and\nprivacy\n- TypeI: 每次1point评价，design of controls的妥当性\n- TypeII: 评价Design controls的妥当性和operating controls的有效性\nmin 6 months time period\nSOC3: // public available \n类似SOC2， more generalized, shorter, less sensitive document\n\n",
