			"seed": 228960966,
			"version": 613,
			"versionNonce": 1208549953,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734877096785,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "上百万行代码，1%有漏洞\n- Static Testing\n- Dynamic Testing\n    * White box\n    * Black Box\nTM/RTM \n软测级别\n- Lv1 Unit Testing单体测试\n- Lv2 Integration Testing\n- Lv3 Component Interface Testing\n- Lv4 Operation Acceptance (pre-release)\nTest Types\n1) Installation Testing\n2) Regression Testing 回归测试\n3) Fuzz Test\n4) Mutating fuzz 修改使出错\n5) All-pairs Testing 遍历所有输入组合\n6) Misuse Case Test\nTest coverage Analysis 判断测试覆盖了多少代码",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "上百万行代码，1%有漏洞\n- Static Testing\n- Dynamic Testing\n    * White box\n    * Black Box\nTM/RTM \n软测级别\n- Lv1 Unit Testing单体测试\n- Lv2 Integration Testing\n- Lv3 Component Interface Testing\n- Lv4 Operation Acceptance (pre-release)\nTest Types\n1) Installation Testing\n2) Regression Testing 回归测试\n3) Fuzz Test\n4) Mutating fuzz 修改使出错\n5) All-pairs Testing 遍历所有输入组合\n6) Misuse Case Test\nTest coverage Analysis 判断测试覆盖了多少代码",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
