		{
			"id": "rtYBhROf",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 23006.86111111111,
			"y": -54.05555555555475,
			"width": 677.1959838867188,
			"height": 1395,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b63",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1891343814,
			"version": 1600,
			"versionNonce": 628783521,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734877096785,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "从Report中对应Threat and Risk\nRisk=Threat x vulnerability\n例：工具 Nessus，OpenVAS\n4个Level\n- Critical\n- High\n- Medium\n- low\n- informational\n\nPen-Test or Ethical Hacking\nAn authorized simulated attack\n➩　Key SOW (statement of work)\n- Which IP ranges, time frame, tools\n- PoC, how to test, what to test\n- 与法务部门确认，与管理层沟通获得许可\n用dummp file 以替代PII，PHI资料\n\n步骤\n1. Discovery (planning)\n2. Gaining a access\n3. Escalate privileges\n4. system browsing\n5. install additional tools\n6. report the findings\n分类\n- Black box (zero knowledge)\n- White box (full knowledge)\n- Gray box (partial)\n\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "HxyKofk9JVRJ1xjEURDRR",
			"originalText": "从Report中对应Threat and Risk\nRisk=Threat x vulnerability\n例：工具 Nessus，OpenVAS\n4个Level\n- Critical\n- High\n- Medium\n- low\n- informational\n\nPen-Test or Ethical Hacking\nAn authorized simulated attack\n➩　Key SOW (statement of work)\n- Which IP ranges, time frame, tools\n- PoC, how to test, what to test\n- 与法务部门确认，与管理层沟通获得许可\n用dummp file 以替代PII，PHI资料\n\n步骤\n1. Discovery (planning)\n2. Gaining a access\n3. Escalate privileges\n4. system browsing\n5. install additional tools\n6. report the findings\n分类\n- Black box (zero knowledge)\n- White box (full knowledge)\n- Gray box (partial)\n\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
