		{
			"id": "Spj227pL",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 5240.861111111115,
			"y": 3431.7777777777774,
			"width": 1039.5357666015625,
			"height": 1080,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b73",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 470180422,
			"version": 718,
			"versionNonce": 1774815066,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734096001961,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Simplex: one-way communication\nhalf-duplex 半双工\nfull-duplex 全双工\n- Baseband: one channel, only send one signal at a time\n- Broadband: multiple channels, send/receive multiple signals\n网络分类\n- Internet\n- Intranet 内网\n- Extranet 内网组成的网络\n\n1）Circuit switching 电路交换\n专线，全带宽，贵\n2）Packet switching\nRouter转发，路径不固定\nQoS (Quality of Service)\n指定Traffic priority\n\nPAN: Personal Area Network\ninclude wired or wireless devices\n(Bluetooth and infrared) 红外线\nMAN：Metropolitan Area Network 城域网\nWAN: Wide Area Network 广域网\nVPN：Virtual Private Network 虚拟专用网\nGAN：Global Area Network",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "S7DqAb6LW7zCAgOsvICCz",
			"originalText": "Simplex: one-way communication\nhalf-duplex 半双工\nfull-duplex 全双工\n- Baseband: one channel, only send one signal at a time\n- Broadband: multiple channels, send/receive multiple signals\n网络分类\n- Internet\n- Intranet 内网\n- Extranet 内网组成的网络\n\n1）Circuit switching 电路交换\n专线，全带宽，贵\n2）Packet switching\nRouter转发，路径不固定\nQoS (Quality of Service)\n指定Traffic priority\n\nPAN: Personal Area Network\ninclude wired or wireless devices\n(Bluetooth and infrared) 红外线\nMAN：Metropolitan Area Network 城域网\nWAN: Wide Area Network 广域网\nVPN：Virtual Private Network 虚拟专用网\nGAN：Global Area Network",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
