			"updated": 1734096721396,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "wires, Fiber, Radio waves, hub, NIC, wireless\n线缆\n- copper TP(双绞线） 不安全(eavesdropping)\ninterference 干扰，easy tap into\n- Fiber 更安全，没有盗听风险\n\n拓扑结构 Topologies\nBus, Star, Ring, Mesh (Partial/Full)\nThreat:\nData, emanation, theft, eavesdropping, sniffing, interference\n数据发射（电磁波），偷窃，盗听，嗅探，干扰",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "X0reA_AeYmRhfnnaUpaOV",
			"originalText": "wires, Fiber, Radio waves, hub, NIC, wireless\n线缆\n- copper TP(双绞线） 不安全(eavesdropping)\ninterference 干扰，easy tap into\n- Fiber 更安全，没有盗听风险\n\n拓扑结构 Topologies\nBus, Star, Ring, Mesh (Partial/Full)\nThreat:\nData, emanation, theft, eavesdropping, sniffing, interference\n数据发射（电磁波），偷窃，盗听，嗅探，干扰",
