			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734096390693,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "LLC：Logical Link Control 检错\nMAC地址\n58 8D 09 A5 54 BA\n前24bit是组织代码，后24位是厂商编码\nThreat\n- MAC spoofing\n- MAC Flooding泛洪\nARP：Address Resolution Protocol L2/L3\nCSMA/CD, CSMA/CA\nToken passing 令牌环，现已不用",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "G7cyNCeFxhYzm_RoS9WMe",
			"originalText": "LLC：Logical Link Control 检错\nMAC地址\n58 8D 09 A5 54 BA\n前24bit是组织代码，后24位是厂商编码\nThreat\n- MAC spoofing\n- MAC Flooding泛洪\nARP：Address Resolution Protocol L2/L3\nCSMA/CD, CSMA/CA\nToken passing 令牌环，现已不用",
