			"updated": 1734096532366,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "隔绝流量至广播域\nIP, ICMP, IPSEC, IGMP, IGRP, IKE, ISAKMP, IPX\nThreats:\n- Ping of Death\n- Ping Floods\n- Smurf (Spoof source and directed broadcast)\n- IP modifications\n- DHCP attacks\n只有IMAP以I开头，但不是L3而是L7的协议",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "sCsSP-_Ud3YUyhmDxpQiD",
			"originalText": "隔绝流量至广播域\nIP, ICMP, IPSEC, IGMP, IGRP, IKE, ISAKMP, IPX\nThreats:\n- Ping of Death\n- Ping Floods\n- Smurf (Spoof source and directed broadcast)\n- IP modifications\n- DHCP attacks\n只有IMAP以I开头，但不是L3而是L7的协议",
