			"seed": 37633222,
			"version": 2249,
			"versionNonce": 34004678,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734096695251,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "SSL/TLS L4 to L7\n➩ UDP: User Datagram Protocol\n攻击：\nFragged attack与Smurf类似\n但成功率更高，因为用的是UDP不是ICMP\n➩ TCP: Transmission Control Protocol\n3次扬\n- SYN A to B\n- SYN/ACK B to A\n- ACK A to B\nAttacks:\n- SYN Floods (Half open TCP sessions)\n报文结构\nNS, ECE, ACK, RST, FIN, CWR, URG, PSH, SYN",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "5HcmACBDMSFZDznVdz0Fg",
			"originalText": "SSL/TLS L4 to L7\n➩ UDP: User Datagram Protocol\n攻击：\nFragged attack与Smurf类似\n但成功率更高，因为用的是UDP不是ICMP\n➩ TCP: Transmission Control Protocol\n3次扬\n- SYN A to B\n- SYN/ACK B to A\n- ACK A to B\nAttacks:\n- SYN Floods (Half open TCP sessions)\n报文结构\nNS, ECE, ACK, RST, FIN, CWR, URG, PSH, SYN",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
