			"originalText": "Present data to user (application/website)\nHTTP, HTTPS, FTP, SNMP, IMAP, POP, ...\nNon-Repudiation, certificate, application proxies, deep packet\ninspection, content inspection, AD integration\nThreats to L5~L7\n- virus\n- worms\n- trojans\n- buffer overflow\n- application/OS vulnerabilities",
