			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "L1：Link Layer ⇔　OSI　L1+L2\n\nL2: Internet Layer ⇔　OSI L3\n\nL3: Transport Layer　⇔　OSI L4\n\nL4: Application Layer ⇔　OSI L5+L6+L7",
