			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734140943875,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "MAC 组织码，内码“唯一”\nEUI/MAC-48 \nEUI-64 扩展到64位的方法是\n组织码不变，内码前加FFFE\n58 8D 09 A5 54 BA　⇒ 58 8D 09 FF FE A5 54 BA\nIPv4 4294967296=2^{32}\nIPv6 340282366920938463463374607431768211456=2^{128}\n\nPort\n- well known 0~1023\n- Registered 1024~49151\n- Private 49152-65535\n\n20 TCP, FTP Data\n21 TCP, FTP Control\n22 TCP/UDP SSH\n23 TCP Telnet明文传送\n25 TCP SMTP或用2525\n80 TCP/UDP HTTP或用8080\n110 TCP POP3\n137 UDP NetBIOS\n138 TCP/UDP NetBIOS Datagram Service\n143 TCP HTTPS\n3389 TCP/UDP RDP",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "77Qb_3GaPTYsUw1MEFpCW",
			"originalText": "MAC 组织码，内码“唯一”\nEUI/MAC-48 \nEUI-64 扩展到64位的方法是\n组织码不变，内码前加FFFE\n58 8D 09 A5 54 BA　⇒ 58 8D 09 FF FE A5 54 BA\nIPv4 4294967296=2^{32}\nIPv6 340282366920938463463374607431768211456=2^{128}\n\nPort\n- well known 0~1023\n- Registered 1024~49151\n- Private 49152-65535\n\n20 TCP, FTP Data\n21 TCP, FTP Control\n22 TCP/UDP SSH\n23 TCP Telnet明文传送\n25 TCP SMTP或用2525\n80 TCP/UDP HTTP或用8080\n110 TCP POP3\n137 UDP NetBIOS\n138 TCP/UDP NetBIOS Datagram Service\n143 TCP HTTPS\n3389 TCP/UDP RDP",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "31wLVrItKPO8DAxRKpTf_",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 7601.508783128583,
			"y": 4378.07445550456,
			"width": 1245,
			"height": 1990,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
