		{
			"id": "iUNWptYf",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 7606.508783128583,
			"y": 4383.07445550456,
			"width": 1176.5517578125,
			"height": 1980,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b7i",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 530997402,
			"version": 2004,
			"versionNonce": 939777370,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734140950263,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "socket\nIP+Port\nUDP只用一个socket（单向，各发各的）,而TCP用2个\n例：\n192.168.06:49691\n195.122.177.218:443\nIPv4/IPv6地址管理⇒　IANA: Internet Assigned Numbers Authority\n上级单位是ICANN: Internet Corporation for Assigned Names and\nNumbers\n按区域分5个支部\n- AFRINIC 非洲\n- ARIN 美加和加勒比海诸国\n- APNIC 亚澳新西兰等\n- LACNIC 拉丁美洲\n- RIPENCC 欧俄中东，中亚\n\nIP Address & Traffic 类型\n- Unicast 单播 \n1对1，如client to server/host\n为了捕获单播流量，我们在网卡(Network IDS/IPS)上使用混杂模式\nPromiscuous mode且所连交换机端口被设为span-port\n- Multicast 组播\n- Broadcast 广播\n    * Limited L3广播 //255.255.255.255过不了路由器\n    * Limited L2广播 //FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF过不了路由器\n    * Directed Broadcast  //同网络内如192.168.19.12/24可以跨VLAN\n\nIPv4\n- Public IP\n- Private IP\n特殊地址段\n- A类 10.0.0.0~10.255.255.255\n- B类 172.16.0.0~172.31.255.255\n- C类 192.168.0.0~192.168.255.255\n- 127.0.0.0/18 Loopback\n- 169.254.0.0/16 Link-local\n- 255.255.255.255 Broadcast\n复用\n- NAT static NAT 1对1不实用/ pool NAT 动态分配 A到B的集合映射\n- PAT(NAPT) 一对多，1 public IP⇒　Multi Private IPs\n\n* 分级地址 ABCDE\n* CIDR：Classless Inter-Domain Routing\n* 子网掩码 Slash Notation",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "31wLVrItKPO8DAxRKpTf_",
			"originalText": "socket\nIP+Port\nUDP只用一个socket（单向，各发各的）,而TCP用2个\n例：\n192.168.06:49691\n195.122.177.218:443\nIPv4/IPv6地址管理⇒　IANA: Internet Assigned Numbers Authority\n上级单位是ICANN: Internet Corporation for Assigned Names and\nNumbers\n按区域分5个支部\n- AFRINIC 非洲\n- ARIN 美加和加勒比海诸国\n- APNIC 亚澳新西兰等\n- LACNIC 拉丁美洲\n- RIPENCC 欧俄中东，中亚\n\nIP Address & Traffic 类型\n- Unicast 单播 \n1对1，如client to server/host\n为了捕获单播流量，我们在网卡(Network IDS/IPS)上使用混杂模式\nPromiscuous mode且所连交换机端口被设为span-port\n- Multicast 组播\n- Broadcast 广播\n    * Limited L3广播 //255.255.255.255过不了路由器\n    * Limited L2广播 //FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF过不了路由器\n    * Directed Broadcast  //同网络内如192.168.19.12/24可以跨VLAN\n\nIPv4\n- Public IP\n- Private IP\n特殊地址段\n- A类 10.0.0.0~10.255.255.255\n- B类 172.16.0.0~172.31.255.255\n- C类 192.168.0.0~192.168.255.255\n- 127.0.0.0/18 Loopback\n- 169.254.0.0/16 Link-local\n- 255.255.255.255 Broadcast\n复用\n- NAT static NAT 1对1不实用/ pool NAT 动态分配 A到B的集合映射\n- PAT(NAPT) 一对多，1 public IP⇒　Multi Private IPs\n\n* 分级地址 ABCDE\n* CIDR：Classless Inter-Domain Routing\n* 子网掩码 Slash Notation",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
