		},
		{
			"id": "HBt4sSAF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 8896.323795742515,
			"y": 4215.111710277612,
			"width": 1077.1556396484375,
			"height": 2205,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b7oG",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1497157574,
			"version": 1282,
			"versionNonce": 24496794,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734141674306,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ARP: Address Resolution Protocol\nRARP: 针对diskless workstation to get IP (没有ARP Cache）\nARP Poisoning 投毒\n因为任何人都能回复ARP Request，攻击者发fake response\n主要攻击gateway\n\nICMP: Internet Control Message Protocol\nPing + Traceroute\nFW and Routers can block ICMP replies\n\nTelent\nSSHv2\n* 2017.7.6维基解密确认CIA已经有SSH的破解工具\n    - Bothanspy ---> XShell (MS平台）\n    - Gyrfalcon ---> OpenSSH (Linux平台）\nFTP 不安全，无C,I要素检查\n升级版 \n1) SFTP: Uses SSH to add security to FTP\n2) FTPS: (FTP Secure) Uses TLS+SSL to FTP\n3) TFTP: UDP Port 69 用于保存路由器配置\n\nDNS：Domain Name System\n1）Authoritative Name servers\n2) Recursive name servers\n3) Cache name servers 无认证\nDNS poisoning\n发Fake address/name when asked\nDNSSEC\n增加认证，使用PKI\n不提供C要素（无数字签名）\n\nSNMP: Simple Network Management Protocol\nv1 and v2是明文发送，应该用v3\n\nLAN局域网技术\nLAN\n- Ethernet\n- Wi-Fi\nCSMA/CD, CSMA/CA\nLegacy LAN systems\nARCNET, Token, Ring, FDDI\n\nWAN广域网技术\n1) Frame Relay L2帧中继\n2) PVC: Permanent Virtual Circuit \n3) SVCC: Switched Virtual Circuit\nX.25\nSONET\nMPLS: Multiprotocol Label switching 转发不基于IP而是Labels",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "0xIc-UMWEZ0_mgNKZVFuD",
			"originalText": "ARP: Address Resolution Protocol\nRARP: 针对diskless workstation to get IP (没有ARP Cache）\nARP Poisoning 投毒\n因为任何人都能回复ARP Request，攻击者发fake response\n主要攻击gateway\n\nICMP: Internet Control Message Protocol\nPing + Traceroute\nFW and Routers can block ICMP replies\n\nTelent\nSSHv2\n* 2017.7.6维基解密确认CIA已经有SSH的破解工具\n    - Bothanspy ---> XShell (MS平台）\n    - Gyrfalcon ---> OpenSSH (Linux平台）\nFTP 不安全，无C,I要素检查\n升级版 \n1) SFTP: Uses SSH to add security to FTP\n2) FTPS: (FTP Secure) Uses TLS+SSL to FTP\n3) TFTP: UDP Port 69 用于保存路由器配置\n\nDNS：Domain Name System\n1）Authoritative Name servers\n2) Recursive name servers\n3) Cache name servers 无认证\nDNS poisoning\n发Fake address/name when asked\nDNSSEC\n增加认证，使用PKI\n不提供C要素（无数字签名）\n\nSNMP: Simple Network Management Protocol\nv1 and v2是明文发送，应该用v3\n\nLAN局域网技术\nLAN\n- Ethernet\n- Wi-Fi\nCSMA/CD, CSMA/CA\nLegacy LAN systems\nARCNET, Token, Ring, FDDI\n\nWAN广域网技术\n1) Frame Relay L2帧中继\n2) PVC: Permanent Virtual Circuit \n3) SVCC: Switched Virtual Circuit\nX.25\nSONET\nMPLS: Multiprotocol Label switching 转发不基于IP而是Labels",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
