			"updated": 1734182585042,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "HTTP and HTTPS\n80/8080   443/8443\nHTML: Hypertext Markup Language\nBOOTP: Bootstrap Protocol 用于决定OS和IP地址\nDHCP： Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol\nDiscovery ⇒　Offer ⇒   Request ⇒　Acknowledge\n共通\n2个Server用Port 67\n协议Client用Port 68\n\nCables RJ45\n电磁干扰 EMI Electromagnetic Interference\ncrosstalk: 串线\nAttenuation 衰减，针对铜线\n\nTwisted Pair Cables\n- UTP: Unshielded Twisted Pair\n- STP: Shielded Twisted Pari",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "Fk2Nv1hR8uo6LNoYzooJ_",
			"originalText": "HTTP and HTTPS\n80/8080   443/8443\nHTML: Hypertext Markup Language\nBOOTP: Bootstrap Protocol 用于决定OS和IP地址\nDHCP： Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol\nDiscovery ⇒　Offer ⇒   Request ⇒　Acknowledge\n共通\n2个Server用Port 67\n协议Client用Port 68\n\nCables RJ45\n电磁干扰 EMI Electromagnetic Interference\ncrosstalk: 串线\nAttenuation 衰减，针对铜线\n\nTwisted Pair Cables\n- UTP: Unshielded Twisted Pair\n- STP: Shielded Twisted Pari",
