			"text": "SDN-WAN: Software-Defined Wide Area Network\n85%受访公司计划布署（2年内）\nPros:\n- Highner cheaper bandwidth\n- flexibility and scalability of bandwidth allocation\n- traffic engineering\n- 兼容性好（DSL,cablee, fiber, satellite, 4G/5G...)\n\nSDLC: Synchronous Data Link Control\nHDLC: High-level Data Link Control\n后继者，3种模式\n- NRM: Normal Response Mode\n- ARM: Asynchronous Response Mode\n- ABM: Asynchronous Balanced Mode\nDNP: Distributed Network Protocol\n用于电力，水道公司，是SCADA系统的关键角色\n\nStorage Protocols\nSAN Storage Area Network\nFCOE Fiber Channel over Ethernet\nFCIP Fiber Channel over IP\nVSAN Virtual Storage Area Network\niSCSI Internet Small Computer System Interface\nVoIP Voice over Internet Protocol\n发Calls，text over 3G/4G, Wi-Fi\n    * H.323\n    * MGCP\n    * RTP Real-Time Transport\n    * RTCP Real-Time Transport Control\n\nSDN\nVXLAN 支持最多16百万虚拟网络\nVLAN只到4096\nSDX Software-Defined Everything\nX包括networking, storage, data center, compute, security, WAN\n无缝连接（设备移动），Multiple APs (Access Points)\nWLAN: Provides Internet connection but not always \nAttacks:\n- Rogue AP 员工自建Wi-Fi等\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWi-Fi有多个不同的频段，如果某几个拥堵，可以肜其他\n2.4GHz 用于Bluetooth，microwaves, cordless phones, baby\nmonitors, Wi-Fi\n    - Jamming/Interference\n    - Evil Twin 冒用SSID\n802.11标准\n有a,b,g,n,ac,ax等标准（带一张表格）\n802.11无线网卡\n4种运行模式\n1）Managed Client Mode\n通过AP与其他Client通信\n2）Infrastructure Mode\n所有AP的SSID一样\n3）Ad-hoc mode\n各点有相同的Channels和SSID\n4）Monitor Mode\nRFMON Radio Frequency Monitor Mode\n监视，不必要先接AP或Ad-hoc\nSS: Service Set\nSSID: Service Set Identifier\nMAC地址过滤，但MAC地址是明文发送的，容易Sniff and spoof\n\nWi-Fi安全\nWEP： Wired Equivalent Privacy 1997 128bit-key\n不可用，不安全\nWPA: Wi-Fi Protected Access 2003\nWPA2: 或叫RSN Robust Security Network 2004\nWPA3: 2020 192-bit key\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "r0RHIGucaGQORR7cNTFGL",
			"originalText": "SDN-WAN: Software-Defined Wide Area Network\n85%受访公司计划布署（2年内）\nPros:\n- Highner cheaper bandwidth\n- flexibility and scalability of bandwidth allocation\n- traffic engineering\n- 兼容性好（DSL,cablee, fiber, satellite, 4G/5G...)\n\nSDLC: Synchronous Data Link Control\nHDLC: High-level Data Link Control\n后继者，3种模式\n- NRM: Normal Response Mode\n- ARM: Asynchronous Response Mode\n- ABM: Asynchronous Balanced Mode\nDNP: Distributed Network Protocol\n用于电力，水道公司，是SCADA系统的关键角色\n\nStorage Protocols\nSAN Storage Area Network\nFCOE Fiber Channel over Ethernet\nFCIP Fiber Channel over IP\nVSAN Virtual Storage Area Network\niSCSI Internet Small Computer System Interface\nVoIP Voice over Internet Protocol\n发Calls，text over 3G/4G, Wi-Fi\n    * H.323\n    * MGCP\n    * RTP Real-Time Transport\n    * RTCP Real-Time Transport Control\n\nSDN\nVXLAN 支持最多16百万虚拟网络\nVLAN只到4096\nSDX Software-Defined Everything\nX包括networking, storage, data center, compute, security, WAN\n无缝连接（设备移动），Multiple APs (Access Points)\nWLAN: Provides Internet connection but not always \nAttacks:\n- Rogue AP 员工自建Wi-Fi等\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWi-Fi有多个不同的频段，如果某几个拥堵，可以肜其他\n2.4GHz 用于Bluetooth，microwaves, cordless phones, baby\nmonitors, Wi-Fi\n    - Jamming/Interference\n    - Evil Twin 冒用SSID\n802.11标准\n有a,b,g,n,ac,ax等标准（带一张表格）\n802.11无线网卡\n4种运行模式\n1）Managed Client Mode\n通过AP与其他Client通信\n2）Infrastructure Mode\n所有AP的SSID一样\n3）Ad-hoc mode\n各点有相同的Channels和SSID\n4）Monitor Mode\nRFMON Radio Frequency Monitor Mode\n监视，不必要先接AP或Ad-hoc\nSS: Service Set\nSSID: Service Set Identifier\nMAC地址过滤，但MAC地址是明文发送的，容易Sniff and spoof\n\nWi-Fi安全\nWEP： Wired Equivalent Privacy 1997 128bit-key\n不可用，不安全\nWPA: Wi-Fi Protected Access 2003\nWPA2: 或叫RSN Robust Security Network 2004\nWPA3: 2020 192-bit key\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
