		{
			"id": "uJz7y9CY",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 10101.899945861589,
			"y": 5673.622303324199,
			"width": 802.979736328125,
			"height": 1395,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bD3V",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1420513734,
			"version": 440,
			"versionNonce": 878733702,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734184314950,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Bluetooth\n提供2.4GHz file exchange\n建立PANs\n- Class 1: 100m\n- Class 2: 10m\n- Class3: <10m\n攻击\n- Bluejacking\n- Bluesnarfing\n- Bluebugging\n对策\n- 只在需要时打开\n- 只在必要时打开可发现\n- 定期更新固件\n\nLi-Fi\nVisible light, ultraviolet 紫外线, infrared 红外线\n100Gb/s\n成本高，容量不如Wi-Fi可作为补充\n\nZigbee：\nMesh Wireless， low power, data rate, close\nproximity\n\nSatellite\n如starlink 马斯克\n20~200Mbps 15~40ms延迟\n\n蜂窝网络 Cellular Networks\n3G,4G,5G\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "CpQ121RNn1mapeBd4yjtx",
			"originalText": "Bluetooth\n提供2.4GHz file exchange\n建立PANs\n- Class 1: 100m\n- Class 2: 10m\n- Class3: <10m\n攻击\n- Bluejacking\n- Bluesnarfing\n- Bluebugging\n对策\n- 只在需要时打开\n- 只在必要时打开可发现\n- 定期更新固件\n\nLi-Fi\nVisible light, ultraviolet 紫外线, infrared 红外线\n100Gb/s\n成本高，容量不如Wi-Fi可作为补充\n\nZigbee：\nMesh Wireless， low power, data rate, close\nproximity\n\nSatellite\n如starlink 马斯克\n20~200Mbps 15~40ms延迟\n\n蜂窝网络 Cellular Networks\n3G,4G,5G\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "2vvw-6dv1IhGceys_2Ktg",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 12169.828003207527,
			"y": 3220.2872145568003,
			"width": 939.0908053479761,
			"height": 1889.4836503824408,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bD5",
			"roundness": {
				"type": 3
			},
			"seed": 1655812122,
			"version": 474,
			"versionNonce": 1765433434,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"id": "IvJqWDp6"
				}
			],
			"updated": 1734184852128,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"customData": {
				"legacyTextWrap": true
			},
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
		{
			"id": "IvJqWDp6",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 12174.828003207527,
			"y": 3225.2872145568003,
			"width": 897.8035888671875,
			"height": 1845,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bD6",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 469277914,
			"version": 1552,
			"versionNonce": 2047658906,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734184850366,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "L1: Repeater 中继器\nHubs 集线器\nL2: Bridges 网桥，隔绝冲突域\nswitch 交换机，用MAC地址表，有一些安全实践（待补\n充）\nL2协议 VLAN\nVLAN Trunks, Ports connecting 2 switches to span\nVLANs across them\nVXLAN:与VLAN有张对照表\nL3: Routers\nMetric\n- Static route: OSPF, EIGRP, BGP, IS-IS\n- Default Gateway 默认网关\n1） Control Plane\n2) Forwarding Plane\nL3协议 收敛 Convergence\n所有IGP都依靠收敛 Interior Gateway Protocols\n\nDistance Vector Routing: RIP, UDP 520 <=16 hop\nHold-down \nRoute poisoning\nsplit-horizon 防止成环\n\nLink-State Routing\n- OSPF v2 用于IPv4 v3用于IPv6\n- BGP Border Gateway Protocol\n\n网络性能和流量管理\nThroughput, Latency, Jitter 抖动\nPacket Loss丢包\nTraffic Flows\n- North-South Traffic 内外流通\n- East-West Traffic 内内流通\n网络流量分析\n工具类\n- NetFlow 思科出品\n- Deep Packett Inspection: DPI\n网络监控与管理\nNOC Network Operations Center\n网络复杂性\nCloud computing, mobile devices, IoT等",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "2vvw-6dv1IhGceys_2Ktg",
			"originalText": "L1: Repeater 中继器\nHubs 集线器\nL2: Bridges 网桥，隔绝冲突域\nswitch 交换机，用MAC地址表，有一些安全实践（待补\n充）\nL2协议 VLAN\nVLAN Trunks, Ports connecting 2 switches to span\nVLANs across them\nVXLAN:与VLAN有张对照表\nL3: Routers\nMetric\n- Static route: OSPF, EIGRP, BGP, IS-IS\n- Default Gateway 默认网关\n1） Control Plane\n2) Forwarding Plane\nL3协议 收敛 Convergence\n所有IGP都依靠收敛 Interior Gateway Protocols\n\nDistance Vector Routing: RIP, UDP 520 <=16 hop\nHold-down \nRoute poisoning\nsplit-horizon 防止成环\n\nLink-State Routing\n- OSPF v2 用于IPv4 v3用于IPv6\n- BGP Border Gateway Protocol\n\n网络性能和流量管理\nThroughput, Latency, Jitter 抖动\nPacket Loss丢包\nTraffic Flows\n- North-South Traffic 内外流通\n- East-West Traffic 内内流通\n网络流量分析\n工具类\n- NetFlow 思科出品\n- Deep Packett Inspection: DPI\n网络监控与管理\nNOC Network Operations Center\n网络复杂性\nCloud computing, mobile devices, IoT等",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "qtt9YbqS",
