			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734185556199,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "FW: Firewalls\n- Packet filtering FW: OSI L1~L3 规则匹配\n- Stateful filtering FW: OSI L1~L4\n- Proxy server\n- Application Layer FW: OSI L7\n- Network FW\n- Host-based FW\n- Next-generation FW: NGFW\nFirewall Design\n- A Bastion Host 只装单一应用\n- A Dual-Homed Host\n- Screened Host Architecture\n- Screened subnet Architecture 用于建立DMZ\nDMZ 2道FW\n\nModem 调解解调器\n- Dial-up modems\n- ADSL modems\n- Cable modems\nDTE: Data Terminal Equipment 终端设备\nDCE：连接设备\n\n安全通信\n认证协议\nPAP Password Authentication Protocol\nCHAP Challenge-Handshake Authentication Protocol\n802.1X 3个部分\n- supplicant 客户端\n- authenticator 如switch或Wireless AP\n- AS Authentication server\nPEAP: Protected EAP\nEAP-MD5 不安全\nLE-AP: Lightweight Extensible Authentication Protocol\nEAP-TLS\nEAP-TTLS\nPANA Protocol for carrying Authentication for Network Access\nSLIP Serial Line Internet Protocol\nPPP 点对点\nPPTP Point-to-Point Tunneling Protocol\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "VsVS8vompg1kKPJNxwEsh",
			"originalText": "FW: Firewalls\n- Packet filtering FW: OSI L1~L3 规则匹配\n- Stateful filtering FW: OSI L1~L4\n- Proxy server\n- Application Layer FW: OSI L7\n- Network FW\n- Host-based FW\n- Next-generation FW: NGFW\nFirewall Design\n- A Bastion Host 只装单一应用\n- A Dual-Homed Host\n- Screened Host Architecture\n- Screened subnet Architecture 用于建立DMZ\nDMZ 2道FW\n\nModem 调解解调器\n- Dial-up modems\n- ADSL modems\n- Cable modems\nDTE: Data Terminal Equipment 终端设备\nDCE：连接设备\n\n安全通信\n认证协议\nPAP Password Authentication Protocol\nCHAP Challenge-Handshake Authentication Protocol\n802.1X 3个部分\n- supplicant 客户端\n- authenticator 如switch或Wireless AP\n- AS Authentication server\nPEAP: Protected EAP\nEAP-MD5 不安全\nLE-AP: Lightweight Extensible Authentication Protocol\nEAP-TLS\nEAP-TTLS\nPANA Protocol for carrying Authentication for Network Access\nSLIP Serial Line Internet Protocol\nPPP 点对点\nPPTP Point-to-Point Tunneling Protocol\n",
