			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "VPN\nL2 TP: Layer 2 Tunneling Protocol\nIPSEC: SA\nISAKMP\n- Tunnel Mode\n- Transport mode\nIKE: Internet Key Exchahnge\nSSL TLS v3.0\nISDN: Integrated Services Digital Network\nDSL: Digital Subscribe Line OSI Layer 1~3\nCallback: 认证系统，用于拨号连接\nCaller ID\n\nRemote Administration\nRDP\nVNC:用于树莓派\nVDI: Thin client (diskless)        \nZero Clients 有Dell，Fujitsu, HP, 松下等\nIM: Instant Messaging\nWeb Conferencing: \nWebEx, Zoom, GotoMeeting, GoogleMeet, Teamviewer,\n\nCDN\nThird-Party connecting\nNAC Newtork Access Control",
