			"updated": 1795530721363,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "min necessary access, no more, no less\n2)Need to know\n3)Separation of Duties 不能既当运动员，又当裁判员\n4)Job Rotation\n5)Mandatory Vacations 不事先通知，防止内部威胁\n其他\nNDA Non-Disclosure Agreement\nBackground Checks 背调\nPrivilege Monitoring 特权账户\nPrivileged Account/Access Management (PAM)\n监视：\nWhat, When, How, Why, Where of what is accessed\nFull monitoring, Limit privilege, MFA, logs/Records\nlooing: all logs from app, and infra, the raw data\nMonitoring\n死活监视，及时响应\n\nThreat Intelligence\nThreat Feeds\n活用 Threat intelligence feed\n巡视，发现可疑情况\n\nUser and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA)\n用机器学习，深度学习技术来分析用户行为\n- Use cases 如何用公司网络数据\n- Data sources \n- Analytics",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "Jm_ueuHdR4aWTOcLDoNwn",
			"originalText": "min necessary access, no more, no less\n2)Need to know\n3)Separation of Duties 不能既当运动员，又当裁判员\n4)Job Rotation\n5)Mandatory Vacations 不事先通知，防止内部威胁\n其他\nNDA Non-Disclosure Agreement\nBackground Checks 背调\nPrivilege Monitoring 特权账户\nPrivileged Account/Access Management (PAM)\n监视：\nWhat, When, How, Why, Where of what is accessed\nFull monitoring, Limit privilege, MFA, logs/Records\nlooing: all logs from app, and infra, the raw data\nMonitoring\n死活监视，及时响应\n\nThreat Intelligence\nThreat Feeds\n活用 Threat intelligence feed\n巡视，发现可疑情况\n\nUser and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA)\n用机器学习，深度学习技术来分析用户行为\n- Use cases 如何用公司网络数据\n- Data sources \n- Analytics",
