			"text": "Digital (Computer) Forensics 电子取证\n流各\n- Identification\n- Preservation\n- Collection\n- Examination\n- Analysis\n- Presentation in court\n- Deciding\nReal Evidence, Evidence Integrity, Chain of custody\nArtifacts (如Computer， Network, mobile device)\nContinuous monitoring\n⇒　all events are recorded for later analysis\n\nDigital Forensics:\nHDD 空间分类\n- Allocated space (有Data）\n- Unallocated space \n- Slack space\n- Bad Blocks/Clusters/ Sectors\n\n⇒　Network Forensics\nNetwork traffic is transmitted and then lost, so ~ is a proactive\ninvestigation\n1) Type I: anomalous traffic\nall log files on a host may be erased by attack, only network-based\nevidencee\n2) Type II: 法庭证据， 检索记录，emails, chat sessions",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "MgNlnX3OIyqZ5bxMufICf",
			"originalText": "Digital (Computer) Forensics 电子取证\n流各\n- Identification\n- Preservation\n- Collection\n- Examination\n- Analysis\n- Presentation in court\n- Deciding\nReal Evidence, Evidence Integrity, Chain of custody\nArtifacts (如Computer， Network, mobile device)\nContinuous monitoring\n⇒　all events are recorded for later analysis\n\nDigital Forensics:\nHDD 空间分类\n- Allocated space (有Data）\n- Unallocated space \n- Slack space\n- Bad Blocks/Clusters/ Sectors\n\n⇒　Network Forensics\nNetwork traffic is transmitted and then lost, so ~ is a proactive\ninvestigation\n1) Type I: anomalous traffic\nall log files on a host may be erased by attack, only network-based\nevidencee\n2) Type II: 法庭证据， 检索记录，emails, chat sessions",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.35,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
