		{
			"id": "wqBIRM4K",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 14895.365546143257,
			"y": 4309.346131873635,
			"width": 1218.923583984375,
			"height": 1935,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bDdV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 872639800,
			"version": 1074,
			"versionNonce": 1973236536,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1734358154574,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "目的：Protect Computer assets, networks and information systems\n3 Categories\n1) Natural\n2) Human\n3) Environmental\nEvent: a change, is state 中性词\nAlert: Triggers warnings if certain event happens\nIncidents: Multiple adverse events\nProblem: Incidence with unknown cause\n其他概念\nInconvenience (non-disasters)\nEmergency (crisis)\nDisaster \nCatastrophe\nIncident Response 8 Steps (图略）\n\nPreventive and Detective Controls\n1) IPS+IDS\n    - Network-based\n    - Host-based\n    - Signature (Pattern) Matching\n    - Heuristic-based (Behavioral)\n2) Intrusion Events and Masking\n3) SIEM\nSIEM often generate more alerts than a SOC team can handle, SOAR\ncan reduce that.\n4) SOAR\n5) Application Positive-listing\n6) Removable Media Controls\n7) Honeypots and Honeynets\n\n防范\n- DLP\n    * Network based system\n    * Endpoint system\n- Physical, guards,\n- E-discovery\n\ndata in two forms\n1) Catch-it-as-you-can 全量存储（要大硬盘）\n2）Stop, look and listen \nEmbedded Device Forensics\n例： SSD, GPS, cell phones, PDA",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "hxRYGSYBFch-c-41Bz5e_",
			"originalText": "目的：Protect Computer assets, networks and information systems\n3 Categories\n1) Natural\n2) Human\n3) Environmental\nEvent: a change, is state 中性词\nAlert: Triggers warnings if certain event happens\nIncidents: Multiple adverse events\nProblem: Incidence with unknown cause\n其他概念\nInconvenience (non-disasters)\nEmergency (crisis)\nDisaster \nCatastrophe\nIncident Response 8 Steps (图略）\n\nPreventive and Detective Controls\n1) IPS+IDS\n    - Network-based\n    - Host-based\n    - Signature (Pattern) Matching\n    - Heuristic-based (Behavioral)\n2) Intrusion Events and Masking\n3) SIEM\nSIEM often generate more alerts than a SOC team can handle, SOAR\ncan reduce that.\n4) SOAR\n5) Application Positive-listing\n6) Removable Media Controls\n7) Honeypots and Honeynets\n\n防范\n- DLP\n    * Network based system\n    * Endpoint system\n- Physical, guards,\n- E-discovery\n\ndata in two forms\n1) Catch-it-as-you-can 全量存储（要大硬盘）\n2）Stop, look and listen \nEmbedded Device Forensics\n例： SSD, GPS, cell phones, PDA",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
