		{
			"id": "1rEQLgx2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 18455.818130546162,
			"y": 3579.3104368104177,
			"width": 1279.79931640625,
			"height": 1485,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 2,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bEA",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 250363945,
			"version": 1126,
			"versionNonce": 2146697810,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721366,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Software-defined security (SDS)\n许多安全措施都是由软件驱动，自动化，监控的（算法驱动世界）\n- Auditing and logging of changes 记录变化\n- Risk Analysis and Mitigation\nIdentify --> Analyze -- >Mitigate\n\n基础概念\n1代 \n- Machine code 机器码\n- Source code 源代码（人类可读）\n2代\n- Assembler Languages 汇编\n- Compiler languages 编译器语言\n- Interpreted Languages 解释器语言\n- Bytecode 类解释器码（字节码）\n- Procedural Languages (procedure-oriented) 面向过程\n- Object-oriented programming (OOP)面向对象\n- 4th Generation Languages (4GL)\n代际分类\n3代： C, C++, Java, Python, Php, Perl, C#, BASIC, Pasal, Fortran,\nALGOL, COBOL, ...\n4代：ABAP, Unix Shell, SQL, PL/SQL, Oracle Reports, R, ...\n5代: Prolog, OPS5, Mercury, ...\nCASE: Computer-aided Software Engineering\n类似于CAD\n3类\n- Tools\n- Workbenches\n- Environments\n\nTop-down programming 自上而下（拆解）\nBottom-up Programming 自下而上（拼接）\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "VtARibrrlR1RlhRgcKEcZ",
			"originalText": "- Software-defined security (SDS)\n许多安全措施都是由软件驱动，自动化，监控的（算法驱动世界）\n- Auditing and logging of changes 记录变化\n- Risk Analysis and Mitigation\nIdentify --> Analyze -- >Mitigate\n\n基础概念\n1代 \n- Machine code 机器码\n- Source code 源代码（人类可读）\n2代\n- Assembler Languages 汇编\n- Compiler languages 编译器语言\n- Interpreted Languages 解释器语言\n- Bytecode 类解释器码（字节码）\n- Procedural Languages (procedure-oriented) 面向过程\n- Object-oriented programming (OOP)面向对象\n- 4th Generation Languages (4GL)\n代际分类\n3代： C, C++, Java, Python, Php, Perl, C#, BASIC, Pasal, Fortran,\nALGOL, COBOL, ...\n4代：ABAP, Unix Shell, SQL, PL/SQL, Oracle Reports, R, ...\n5代: Prolog, OPS5, Mercury, ...\nCASE: Computer-aided Software Engineering\n类似于CAD\n3类\n- Tools\n- Workbenches\n- Environments\n\nTop-down programming 自上而下（拆解）\nBottom-up Programming 自下而上（拼接）\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
