			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721367,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Open Source 开源 如LLM羊驼\n- Closed source 闭源，商业软件\n- Proprietary Software 受版权保护（可以是开源也可以是闭源）\n- Free Software\n    * Shareware 有试用（全功能）期限的软件\n    * Crippleware 不完全软件\nEULAs End-User License Agreements\n\nSoftware Licenses\n- GNU General Public License also called GPL 派生品也必须使用GPL\n- BSD Berkeley Software Distribution\n- Apache\n\nSoftware Development Methodologies\n1） Waterfall\nsystem requirements\n    -> Software ~\n        ->Preliminary design\n            ->Detailed Design\n                ->Code and debugging\n                    ->Testing\n                        ->Operations & maintenance\n\n2) Sashimi Mock\n2个Phase总有重叠\n3) Agil software development 敏捷开发，同1）但是双箭头\n4)Manifesto for Agile software development\n12 Principles\n5）Scrum 适肜于10人团队，2周的玒发周期（称为Sprints)冲刺\n并列争球 3rols\n- Product owner\n- Development team\n- scrum master\n6) XP (Extreme Programming)\n扁平化管理\n7) Spiral Model (Risk-driven)\n8) RAD: Rapid Application Development\n9) Prototyping 把项目分为小任务\nSDLC: software development life cycle\n\nProjects, Programs, and Portfolios\n- PJ, a temporary endeavor, with start and end\n- program, a collection of related projects\n- portfolio, a collect of PJ and programs \n\nIPT: Integrated Product Team\n- oversight IPTs\n- working-level IPTs\n\nSource Code Escrow\nSource Code Repositories\nAPI Security (OWASP topo 10)\n- Authentication\n- Access Control\n- Input validation\n- Output encoding/escaping\n- Cryptography\n- Error handling and logging\n- Communication security\n- HTTP security and Security configuration\n\nSoftware Change and Configuration Management\nNIST 80-128: Guide for Security-Focused Configuration Management of\nInformation Systems\n- A Configuration Management Plan (CM Plan)\n    * Configuration Control Board (CCB)\n    * Configuration Item Identification\n    * Configuration Change Control\n    * Configuration Monitoring\n\nDevOps\n    CI/CD Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery\nDevSecOps\n    security to be integrated throughout the development process\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "crpKozAMInvsJ2ZXTuJpJ",
			"originalText": "- Open Source 开源 如LLM羊驼\n- Closed source 闭源，商业软件\n- Proprietary Software 受版权保护（可以是开源也可以是闭源）\n- Free Software\n    * Shareware 有试用（全功能）期限的软件\n    * Crippleware 不完全软件\nEULAs End-User License Agreements\n\nSoftware Licenses\n- GNU General Public License also called GPL 派生品也必须使用GPL\n- BSD Berkeley Software Distribution\n- Apache\n\nSoftware Development Methodologies\n1） Waterfall\nsystem requirements\n    -> Software ~\n        ->Preliminary design\n            ->Detailed Design\n                ->Code and debugging\n                    ->Testing\n                        ->Operations & maintenance\n\n2) Sashimi Mock\n2个Phase总有重叠\n3) Agil software development 敏捷开发，同1）但是双箭头\n4)Manifesto for Agile software development\n12 Principles\n5）Scrum 适肜于10人团队，2周的玒发周期（称为Sprints)冲刺\n并列争球 3rols\n- Product owner\n- Development team\n- scrum master\n6) XP (Extreme Programming)\n扁平化管理\n7) Spiral Model (Risk-driven)\n8) RAD: Rapid Application Development\n9) Prototyping 把项目分为小任务\nSDLC: software development life cycle\n\nProjects, Programs, and Portfolios\n- PJ, a temporary endeavor, with start and end\n- program, a collection of related projects\n- portfolio, a collect of PJ and programs \n\nIPT: Integrated Product Team\n- oversight IPTs\n- working-level IPTs\n\nSource Code Escrow\nSource Code Repositories\nAPI Security (OWASP topo 10)\n- Authentication\n- Access Control\n- Input validation\n- Output encoding/escaping\n- Cryptography\n- Error handling and logging\n- Communication security\n- HTTP security and Security configuration\n\nSoftware Change and Configuration Management\nNIST 80-128: Guide for Security-Focused Configuration Management of\nInformation Systems\n- A Configuration Management Plan (CM Plan)\n    * Configuration Control Board (CCB)\n    * Configuration Item Identification\n    * Configuration Change Control\n    * Configuration Monitoring\n\nDevOps\n    CI/CD Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery\nDevSecOps\n    security to be integrated throughout the development process\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
