			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795530721368,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Scaled Agile Frameworks-SAFe\n- Agile Development\n- Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe)\n- SAFe Structure\n    * Teams and Agile Release Trains (ARTs)\n    * Program Increment (PI) Planning\n    * Lean Portfolio Management\n- SAFe Principles\n    * Lean Agile Principles\n    * Agile Project Delivery\n    * Enterprise Solution Delivery\n    * Lean Agile Leadership\n- Integrating Security Practices into SAFe\n    * Built-in Quality\n    * CI/CD Pipeline\n    * Threat Modeling\n    * Security Champions\n    * Security Working Group\n    * Portfolio Level Security\n- DevSecOps in SAFe\n- Implementing SAFe and Integrating Security Practices\n\nDatabases\n- DBMS Database Management System\n- definition, creation, querying, update and administration of databases\n- MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MariaDB, Microsoft SQL Server, Oracle,\nSybase, SAPP HANA, SQLite and IBM DB2\n- Relational Model\n    * Foreign Kye\n- Integrity\n    * Referential integrity\n    * Semantic integrity\n    * Entity integrity\n    * User-Defined Integrity\n\n- Stability\n- Performance\n- Re-usability\n- Maintainability\n\n- Database Normalization 3 rules\n    * First Normal Form\n    * Second Normal Form\n    * Third Normal Form\n\n- Database Views\n- Data Dictionary\n    * Database Schema\n- Database Query Language\n    * Data Definition Language (DDL)\n    * Data Manipulation Language (DML)\n- Hierarchical Databases\n比如Windows系统中的注册表\n- Object-Oriented Databases\n    * Attributes\n    * Methods\n    * Classes\n1) Database Shadowing\n2) Electronic Vaulting: remote backup\n3) Remote Journaling\n\n- Coupling\n- Cohesion\n- ORB (Object Request Broker)\n    * COM Component Object Model\n    * DCOM Distributed COM\n    * CORBA Common Object Request Broker Architecture\n- OOAD Object-Oriented Analysis and Design\n    * OOA \n    * OOD\n    * OOM Object-Oriented Modeling\n- ACID Model\n    * Atomicity\n    * Consistency\n    * Isolation\n    * Durability",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "J9GeAnsDzwmUCF8yIezwO",
			"originalText": "Scaled Agile Frameworks-SAFe\n- Agile Development\n- Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe)\n- SAFe Structure\n    * Teams and Agile Release Trains (ARTs)\n    * Program Increment (PI) Planning\n    * Lean Portfolio Management\n- SAFe Principles\n    * Lean Agile Principles\n    * Agile Project Delivery\n    * Enterprise Solution Delivery\n    * Lean Agile Leadership\n- Integrating Security Practices into SAFe\n    * Built-in Quality\n    * CI/CD Pipeline\n    * Threat Modeling\n    * Security Champions\n    * Security Working Group\n    * Portfolio Level Security\n- DevSecOps in SAFe\n- Implementing SAFe and Integrating Security Practices\n\nDatabases\n- DBMS Database Management System\n- definition, creation, querying, update and administration of databases\n- MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MariaDB, Microsoft SQL Server, Oracle,\nSybase, SAPP HANA, SQLite and IBM DB2\n- Relational Model\n    * Foreign Kye\n- Integrity\n    * Referential integrity\n    * Semantic integrity\n    * Entity integrity\n    * User-Defined Integrity\n\n- Stability\n- Performance\n- Re-usability\n- Maintainability\n\n- Database Normalization 3 rules\n    * First Normal Form\n    * Second Normal Form\n    * Third Normal Form\n\n- Database Views\n- Data Dictionary\n    * Database Schema\n- Database Query Language\n    * Data Definition Language (DDL)\n    * Data Manipulation Language (DML)\n- Hierarchical Databases\n比如Windows系统中的注册表\n- Object-Oriented Databases\n    * Attributes\n    * Methods\n    * Classes\n1) Database Shadowing\n2) Electronic Vaulting: remote backup\n3) Remote Journaling\n\n- Coupling\n- Cohesion\n- ORB (Object Request Broker)\n    * COM Component Object Model\n    * DCOM Distributed COM\n    * CORBA Common Object Request Broker Architecture\n- OOAD Object-Oriented Analysis and Design\n    * OOA \n    * OOD\n    * OOM Object-Oriented Modeling\n- ACID Model\n    * Atomicity\n    * Consistency\n    * Isolation\n    * Durability",
			"autoResize": true,
