			"text": "COTS Commercial Off-the-Shelf Software\nCustom-Developed Third-Party Products\nCloud Computing\n    - Private Cloud Computing\n    - Public Cloud Computing\n    - Hybrid Cloud Computing\n    - Community Cloud Computing\n\nPlatforms\n    - IaaS\n    - PaaS\n    - SaaS\n\nSoftware Composition Analysis (SCA)\n    - Software Composition\n    - Software Component Analysis (SA)\n        * Benefits of SCA\n            + Early risk detection\n            + Continuous monitoring\n            + License compliance\n            + Dependency management\n        * Implementing SCA Effectively\n        * Limitations of SCA\n        * Challenges with SCA",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "GdjqlvVtD5wkyLrse_UyW",
			"originalText": "COTS Commercial Off-the-Shelf Software\nCustom-Developed Third-Party Products\nCloud Computing\n    - Private Cloud Computing\n    - Public Cloud Computing\n    - Hybrid Cloud Computing\n    - Community Cloud Computing\n\nPlatforms\n    - IaaS\n    - PaaS\n    - SaaS\n\nSoftware Composition Analysis (SCA)\n    - Software Composition\n    - Software Component Analysis (SA)\n        * Benefits of SCA\n            + Early risk detection\n            + Continuous monitoring\n            + License compliance\n            + Dependency management\n        * Implementing SCA Effectively\n        * Limitations of SCA\n        * Challenges with SCA",
