		{
			"id": "esGdIWVV",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1000.7883686413975,
			"y": 3258.8938446495686,
			"width": 924.0556640625,
			"height": 1505,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e03131",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bEU",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 671408161,
			"version": 2068,
			"versionNonce": 1210850689,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1735286149831,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "DAC Discretionary Access Control\nMAC: Mandatory Access Control [Clearance + Labels]\nRBAC: Role Based Access Control\nABAC: Attribute Based Access Control\n    - Subject (user) Name, Role, ID, clearance\n    - Object (resource) Name, Owner, date of creation\n    - Environment Location, time of access, threat levels\nROBAC: Rule based Access control\nIF/THEN 语句\n\nBell-Lapadula (Confidentiality)\n --> No Read Up\n --> No Write Down\n --> No Read or Write Up and Down\nBIBA: Integrity (MAC)\n --> No Read Down\n --> No Write Up\n --> No Read or Write up\nLattice Based Access Control (LBAC) (MAC)\nGraham-Deming Model\n[Objects, Subjects, Rules]\n8 Rules\nHUR model {Harrison, Ruzzo, Ullman}\n6 Operations\nClark-Wilson Integrity\n[Subject, Program, Object]\n只提供必要的interface\n--> Separation of duties 职权分离\n--> Well-formed transaction\nBrewer-Nash\nChinese Wall or Information Barries 墙\nNon-Interference Model\nTake-Grant Protection Model\n4 Rules\n    - Take\n    - Grant\n    - Create\n    - Remove\nZachman Framework\n six frameworks\nWhat, How, Where, Who, When, Why\nMap to rules for Planner, Owner, Designer, Builder, Programmer, User\n",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "7C_OLwiCUKYLwU-Ord_tr",
			"originalText": "DAC Discretionary Access Control\nMAC: Mandatory Access Control [Clearance + Labels]\nRBAC: Role Based Access Control\nABAC: Attribute Based Access Control\n    - Subject (user) Name, Role, ID, clearance\n    - Object (resource) Name, Owner, date of creation\n    - Environment Location, time of access, threat levels\nROBAC: Rule based Access control\nIF/THEN 语句\n\nBell-Lapadula (Confidentiality)\n --> No Read Up\n --> No Write Down\n --> No Read or Write Up and Down\nBIBA: Integrity (MAC)\n --> No Read Down\n --> No Write Up\n --> No Read or Write up\nLattice Based Access Control (LBAC) (MAC)\nGraham-Deming Model\n[Objects, Subjects, Rules]\n8 Rules\nHUR model {Harrison, Ruzzo, Ullman}\n6 Operations\nClark-Wilson Integrity\n[Subject, Program, Object]\n只提供必要的interface\n--> Separation of duties 职权分离\n--> Well-formed transaction\nBrewer-Nash\nChinese Wall or Information Barries 墙\nNon-Interference Model\nTake-Grant Protection Model\n4 Rules\n    - Take\n    - Grant\n    - Create\n    - Remove\nZachman Framework\n six frameworks\nWhat, How, Where, Who, When, Why\nMap to rules for Planner, Owner, Designer, Builder, Programmer, User\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
