		},
		{
			"id": "8QwFMeLF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3032.931225784254,
			"y": 3256.9295589352837,
			"width": 936.5716552734375,
			"height": 1890,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e03131",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bEY",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 481579233,
			"version": 3664,
			"versionNonce": 1048892673,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1735286149831,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "如何选择供应商\n早期\n1）The orange book\nThe trusted computer system evaluation criteria (TCSEC)\nThe Red book Trusted Network Interpretation (TNI)\n2)ITSEC The European Information Technology Security Evaluation\nCriteria\n3) The International common criteria (ISO/IEC 15408)\nconfirm target's security feature\n--> Target of Evaluation (ToE)\n--> Protection Profile CPP\n--> Security Target (ST)\n4) EAL: Evaluation Assurance Level\nLv1~7\nLv1: Functionally Tested\nLv2: Structurally Tested\nLv3: Methodically Tested and checked\nLv4: Methodically Designed, Tested and Reviewed\nLv5: Semi-formally Designed Tested\nLv6: Semi-formally verified, Designed and Tested\nLv7: Formally verified Designed and Tested\n\nSecure Design Principles\n- Least Privilege\n- Need to know\n- separation of duties\n- Defense in Depth\n- Secure defaults\n- Fail securely\n- Keep it simple\nto better understood and accepted\n- Threat Modeling\n- Trust but verify 主要威胁来自特权账户\n- Zero Trust (Never Trust, always verify)\nNIST SP800-2017\n- Privacy by Design\n- Shared Responsibility 对云服务场景\n\n* PASTA (Attacker Focused)\n    Process for attack simulation and Threat analysis\n    7-step: DO, DTS, ADA, TA< WVA, AMS, RAM\n* STRIDE (Developer Focused)\n    巨硬提出 6类威胁\n    spoofing <> Authenticity \n    tampering<>Integrity\n    repudiation<> Non-repudiability\n    Information disclosure<>confidentiality\n    Denial of service (DoS)<> Availability\n    Elevation of privilege <>Authorization\n*Trike (Acceptable Risk Focused)\n*Dread\n    Disaster/Damage, Reproducibility, Exploitability, Affected User,\nDiscoverability\n每类打分1到10，由MS提出，2008年废除",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "M4Ei9XEm-pTXUw-PEPFiD",
			"originalText": "如何选择供应商\n早期\n1）The orange book\nThe trusted computer system evaluation criteria (TCSEC)\nThe Red book Trusted Network Interpretation (TNI)\n2)ITSEC The European Information Technology Security Evaluation\nCriteria\n3) The International common criteria (ISO/IEC 15408)\nconfirm target's security feature\n--> Target of Evaluation (ToE)\n--> Protection Profile CPP\n--> Security Target (ST)\n4) EAL: Evaluation Assurance Level\nLv1~7\nLv1: Functionally Tested\nLv2: Structurally Tested\nLv3: Methodically Tested and checked\nLv4: Methodically Designed, Tested and Reviewed\nLv5: Semi-formally Designed Tested\nLv6: Semi-formally verified, Designed and Tested\nLv7: Formally verified Designed and Tested\n\nSecure Design Principles\n- Least Privilege\n- Need to know\n- separation of duties\n- Defense in Depth\n- Secure defaults\n- Fail securely\n- Keep it simple\nto better understood and accepted\n- Threat Modeling\n- Trust but verify 主要威胁来自特权账户\n- Zero Trust (Never Trust, always verify)\nNIST SP800-2017\n- Privacy by Design\n- Shared Responsibility 对云服务场景\n\n* PASTA (Attacker Focused)\n    Process for attack simulation and Threat analysis\n    7-step: DO, DTS, ADA, TA< WVA, AMS, RAM\n* STRIDE (Developer Focused)\n    巨硬提出 6类威胁\n    spoofing <> Authenticity \n    tampering<>Integrity\n    repudiation<> Non-repudiability\n    Information disclosure<>confidentiality\n    Denial of service (DoS)<> Availability\n    Elevation of privilege <>Authorization\n*Trike (Acceptable Risk Focused)\n*Dread\n    Disaster/Damage, Reproducibility, Exploitability, Affected User,\nDiscoverability\n每类打分1到10，由MS提出，2008年废除",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
