			"text": "Secure System Design Concepts\n1) Layering\nApplication<>OS<>Kernel and Device Drivers<>Hardware\n2)Abstraction\n对用户隐藏不必要的细节\n3）Security Domains\n- Kernel Mode 监管模式\n此地crasheds不能恢复\n- User mode 通过API调用，访问，crashes可恢复\n- Open and closed systems\n使用开放标准，和多个供应商的组件（普遍采用）\n专用HW，SW\n\nSASE新提出的框架\nsecure access service edge\n组成\n1) Software-defined wide-area networking\nSD-WAN\n2)Integrated Security Functions\n3)Cloud-Native Architecture\n4)Zero-Trust Model\n流程\n- Remote employee request access to cloud-based app (point of\npresence)\n- Request is routed to nearest pop\n- pop evaluates request\n- safe \n- forwarded to app\nBenefits\n- Scalability\n- simplifies management\n- reduces complexity and lower cost\n\nSecure HW架构\n- system unit 机箱和内部\n- Motherboard 母板\n- Peripherals 外设\n- Regular computer bus\n南北桥 Northbridge and southbridge\nCPU\n    - ALU Arithmetic logic unit\n    - control unit\n    - fetch, decode, execute, store 4步\n\n- multithreading\n- multiprocessing\n- multi programming\n\npipeline 流水线\ninterrupt 中断\nprocess --> 多个状态 (new, ready, running, blocked, terminate)\nthread 线程\nLWP 轻进程\ntask 重进程\n\n保护措施\n1) memory protection\n2) process isolation\n3) hardware segmentation\n常用技术\n1) virtual memory\n2) swapping\n3) paging\n\n微服务 micro services\ncontainerization OS-Level虚拟化\nserverless 与virtualization 对比 放表格里\n\n内核 Kernel\n1) monolithic kernel 巨核\n2) Microkernels 微核\nReference monitor 控制subjects / objects\n间的访问，永远在线，不可bypass\n\nBIOS\nWORM Media: Write once read many\nCD/DVDs\nTPM win 11要求 Trusted Platform module\n\n5态DEP Data Execution Prevention\naddress space layout randomization (ASLR)\n防止buffer-overflows\n\nUsers and File Permissions\nLinux/UNIX\nread(r), write(w), and execute(x) set at owner, group or world level\nWindows NTFS (New Technology File System)\nread, write, read and execute, modify, full control\na type of DAC model",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "r8FpFHOKdasbQPQmfNVeu",
			"originalText": "Secure System Design Concepts\n1) Layering\nApplication<>OS<>Kernel and Device Drivers<>Hardware\n2)Abstraction\n对用户隐藏不必要的细节\n3）Security Domains\n- Kernel Mode 监管模式\n此地crasheds不能恢复\n- User mode 通过API调用，访问，crashes可恢复\n- Open and closed systems\n使用开放标准，和多个供应商的组件（普遍采用）\n专用HW，SW\n\nSASE新提出的框架\nsecure access service edge\n组成\n1) Software-defined wide-area networking\nSD-WAN\n2)Integrated Security Functions\n3)Cloud-Native Architecture\n4)Zero-Trust Model\n流程\n- Remote employee request access to cloud-based app (point of\npresence)\n- Request is routed to nearest pop\n- pop evaluates request\n- safe \n- forwarded to app\nBenefits\n- Scalability\n- simplifies management\n- reduces complexity and lower cost\n\nSecure HW架构\n- system unit 机箱和内部\n- Motherboard 母板\n- Peripherals 外设\n- Regular computer bus\n南北桥 Northbridge and southbridge\nCPU\n    - ALU Arithmetic logic unit\n    - control unit\n    - fetch, decode, execute, store 4步\n\n- multithreading\n- multiprocessing\n- multi programming\n\npipeline 流水线\ninterrupt 中断\nprocess --> 多个状态 (new, ready, running, blocked, terminate)\nthread 线程\nLWP 轻进程\ntask 重进程\n\n保护措施\n1) memory protection\n2) process isolation\n3) hardware segmentation\n常用技术\n1) virtual memory\n2) swapping\n3) paging\n\n微服务 micro services\ncontainerization OS-Level虚拟化\nserverless 与virtualization 对比 放表格里\n\n内核 Kernel\n1) monolithic kernel 巨核\n2) Microkernels 微核\nReference monitor 控制subjects / objects\n间的访问，永远在线，不可bypass\n\nBIOS\nWORM Media: Write once read many\nCD/DVDs\nTPM win 11要求 Trusted Platform module\n\n5态DEP Data Execution Prevention\naddress space layout randomization (ASLR)\n防止buffer-overflows\n\nUsers and File Permissions\nLinux/UNIX\nread(r), write(w), and execute(x) set at owner, group or world level\nWindows NTFS (New Technology File System)\nread, write, read and execute, modify, full control\na type of DAC model",
