			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1735286149831,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "IoT The Internet of Things\n- never patches\n- have very basic security (default ID/PW, well-known ports)\n\nEmanations and Convert Channels\n- get info. from electrical changes from a system or a wire\n\ncovert channels\n- covert timing channels\n- covert storage channels\n- steganography (hiding a message within another media)\n- digital watermarks\n\nMalware\n- viruses\n    * Macro\n    * Boot Sector\n    * Stealth\n    * Polymorphic viruses\n    * Multipart viruses\n- worms\n- Trojans\n- Rootkits\n- Logic Bombs\n- Packers\n- Antivirus Software\n    * Signatures based\n    - Heuristic (behavioral) based\n- Server-Side Attacks\n- Client-side attacks\n\nWeb Architecture attacks\n- Applets\n    * Java applets\n    * ActiveX\n- OWASP \n- XML \n- SOA Service-Oriented Architecture",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "MsQ01CAbbh2e-uIqpbyr0",
			"originalText": "IoT The Internet of Things\n- never patches\n- have very basic security (default ID/PW, well-known ports)\n\nEmanations and Convert Channels\n- get info. from electrical changes from a system or a wire\n\ncovert channels\n- covert timing channels\n- covert storage channels\n- steganography (hiding a message within another media)\n- digital watermarks\n\nMalware\n- viruses\n    * Macro\n    * Boot Sector\n    * Stealth\n    * Polymorphic viruses\n    * Multipart viruses\n- worms\n- Trojans\n- Rootkits\n- Logic Bombs\n- Packers\n- Antivirus Software\n    * Signatures based\n    - Heuristic (behavioral) based\n- Server-Side Attacks\n- Client-side attacks\n\nWeb Architecture attacks\n- Applets\n    * Java applets\n    * ActiveX\n- OWASP \n- XML \n- SOA Service-Oriented Architecture",
