			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1735286149831,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Database Security\n- Polyinstantiation\n- Aggregation\n- Inference\n- Data mining\n- Data Analytics\n\nMobile Security\n- USB, CDs, laptops, cell phones ...\n- Good security policies\n- cell phones lost incident\n    * MDM\n- Laptops\n    * BYOD \n    * on/off boarding\n\nICS: Industrial Control System\n- SCADA Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition\n- DCS Distributed Control Systems\n- PLC Programmable Logic Controllers\n- DNP3 Distributed Network Protocol\n\nCryptography helps us for C,I,A\ncryptology 加密通信的学科\nCryptography 加密算法\n- Monoalphabetic Ciphers\n- Polyalphabetic Ciphers\n- Frequency Analysis\nHistory\n- Spartan Scytale\n- Caesar Cipher (Substitution)\n- Vigenère cipher\n- Cipher Disk\n- Enigma\n- Purple\n- One-Time Pad\n- Vernam Cipher\n- The Jefferson Disk\n- SIGABA\n相关法规\n- COCOM Coordinating Committee of Multilateral Export\nControls\n- Wassenaar Arrangement ",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "-Hg0f6lt5kisMH4SBkzal",
			"originalText": "Database Security\n- Polyinstantiation\n- Aggregation\n- Inference\n- Data mining\n- Data Analytics\n\nMobile Security\n- USB, CDs, laptops, cell phones ...\n- Good security policies\n- cell phones lost incident\n    * MDM\n- Laptops\n    * BYOD \n    * on/off boarding\n\nICS: Industrial Control System\n- SCADA Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition\n- DCS Distributed Control Systems\n- PLC Programmable Logic Controllers\n- DNP3 Distributed Network Protocol\n\nCryptography helps us for C,I,A\ncryptology 加密通信的学科\nCryptography 加密算法\n- Monoalphabetic Ciphers\n- Polyalphabetic Ciphers\n- Frequency Analysis\nHistory\n- Spartan Scytale\n- Caesar Cipher (Substitution)\n- Vigenère cipher\n- Cipher Disk\n- Enigma\n- Purple\n- One-Time Pad\n- Vernam Cipher\n- The Jefferson Disk\n- SIGABA\n相关法规\n- COCOM Coordinating Committee of Multilateral Export\nControls\n- Wassenaar Arrangement ",
