			"updated": 1735286149831,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "加密方式\n- Asymmetric 公开键\n    * Prime Number Factorization\n    * Discrete Logarithms\n    * RSA cryptography\n    * Diffie-Hellman (DH)\n    * ECC\n    * ELGamal\n    * DSA\n    * Knapsack\n- Symmetric 共通键 \n    * DES\n    * ECB\n    * CBC\n    * CFB\n    * OFB\n    * CTR\n    * 3DES\n    * IDEA\n    * AES\n    * Blowfish\n    * Twofish\n    * Feisetl cipher\n    * RC4\n    * RC5\n    * RC6\n- Hybrid 混合\n\nHash Functions 哈希函数 for integrity\nvariable-length plaintext --. fixed-length value hash\nCollisions\n- MD5 (message digest 5)\n- MD6 (message digest 6)\n- SHA1, SHA2, SHA3 \n- HAVAL \n- RIPEMD\n- RIPEMD160\n\nSalt (Salting)\nNonce\ncryptanalysis 解密\nCipher \n- Plaintext (cleartext)\n- Ciphertext\n- Encryption\n- Decryption\nBook Cipher 密码本\nRunning-Key Cipher\n",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ab4-GSzgaVJ6g8Qqo4bJv",
			"originalText": "加密方式\n- Asymmetric 公开键\n    * Prime Number Factorization\n    * Discrete Logarithms\n    * RSA cryptography\n    * Diffie-Hellman (DH)\n    * ECC\n    * ELGamal\n    * DSA\n    * Knapsack\n- Symmetric 共通键 \n    * DES\n    * ECB\n    * CBC\n    * CFB\n    * OFB\n    * CTR\n    * 3DES\n    * IDEA\n    * AES\n    * Blowfish\n    * Twofish\n    * Feisetl cipher\n    * RC4\n    * RC5\n    * RC6\n- Hybrid 混合\n\nHash Functions 哈希函数 for integrity\nvariable-length plaintext --. fixed-length value hash\nCollisions\n- MD5 (message digest 5)\n- MD6 (message digest 6)\n- SHA1, SHA2, SHA3 \n- HAVAL \n- RIPEMD\n- RIPEMD160\n\nSalt (Salting)\nNonce\ncryptanalysis 解密\nCipher \n- Plaintext (cleartext)\n- Ciphertext\n- Encryption\n- Decryption\nBook Cipher 密码本\nRunning-Key Cipher\n",
